{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07323","headline":"冬夜宿扬州开元寺烈公房送李侍御之江东 · 刘长卿","name":"冬夜宿扬州开元寺烈公房送李侍御之江东","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迁客投百越，穷阴淮海凝。\n中原驰困兽，万里栖饥鹰。\n寂寂连宇下，爱君心自弘。\n空堂来霜气，永夜清明灯。\n发後望烟水，相思劳寝兴。\n暮帆背楚郭，江色浮金陵。\n此去尔何恨，近名予未能。\n炉峰若便道，爲访东林僧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07323.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07323","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}